<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/LifecycleScopeType/runtime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/IsoAutomationLevel/fullAutomation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Level 5 - Full automation. The system is capable of performing its entire mission without external intervention."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/VirtualHardware> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
